# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# INTENTIONALLY NOT PUBLISHED — unpublished manuscript material
#
# The manuscript and its submission package are excluded so that this
# repository does not constitute pre-publication of the full text. Only the
# analysis code and the result tables that support the Data Availability
# statement are published here.
#
# Excluded: manuscript_v1.md, submission/*, the outline, the internal review
# committee records and the reviewer-assessment notes.
# Published: docs/manuscript/review/audit_*.md and numbers_ledger_*.md, which
# are methodological provenance documents (what number comes from which file),
# not manuscript text.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
docs/manuscript/manuscript_v1.md
docs/manuscript/00_outline.md
